# No em dashes

Do **not** use Unicode U+2014 (em dash) or U+2013 (en dash) anywhere in user-facing or authored content.

Applies to: `i18n.js` strings, UI labels/help text, README/ARCHITECTURE/PROGRESS prose, and any new copy.

## Prefer instead

| Instead of | Use |
|------------|-----|
| long-dash clause break | period, comma, colon, or parentheses |
| soft aside | ` - ` (spaced hyphen) or rewrite the sentence |
| numeric/date ranges | `to` or hyphen, e.g. `10 to 20` or `2024-2026` |
